" or \"us\" means Baxter International Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise requires.","zh":null},{"en":"On August 12, 2024, we entered into an Equity Purchase Agreement (EPA) with certain affiliates of Carlyle Group Inc. (Carlyle) to sell our Kidney Care business. That business, which is now known as Vantive Health LLC (Vantive) is comprised of our former Kidney Care segment. On January 31, 2025, we completed the sale of our Kidney Care business to Carlyle for an aggregate purchase price of $3.80 billion in cash, subject to certain closing cash, working capital and debt adjustments. After giving effect to certain adjustments, we received approximately $3.71 billion pre-tax cash proceeds at closing of the transaction with the net after tax proceeds of approximately $3.3 billion, prior to giving effects to certain post-closing adjustments. As of December 31, 2025, we repaid $3.81 billion of legacy indebtedness in 2025 (which repayment does not include $2.00 billion of indebtedness repaid wit","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"We currently manage our global operations based on three reportable segments: Medical Products & Therapies, Healthcare Systems & Technologies and Pharmaceuticals.","zh":null},{"en":"The Medical Products & Therapies segment includes sales of our sterile IV solutions, infusion systems, administration sets, parenteral nutrition therapies and surgical hemostat, sealant and adhesion prevention products. The Healthcare Systems & Technologies segment includes sales of our connected care solutions and collaboration tools, including smart bed systems, patient monitoring systems and diagnostic technologies, respiratory health devices and advanced equipment for the surgical space, including operating room integration technologies, precision positioning devices and other accessories. The Pharmaceuticals segment includes sales of specialty injectable pharmaceuticals, inhaled anesthetics and drug compounding services.","zh":null}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Medical Products & Therapies","val":5299000000,"zh":"Medical Products & Therapies"},{"name":"Healthcare Systems & Technologies","val":3071000000,"zh":"Healthcare Systems & Technologies"},{"name":"Pharmaceuticals","val":2493000000,"zh":"Pharmaceuticals"}],"total":11244000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6122000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":5122000000,"zh":"Non Us"},{"name":"Western Europe Canada Japan Australia & New Zealand","val":3728000000,"zh":"Western Europe Canada Japan Australia & New Zealand"},{"name":"Eastern Europe Middle East Africa Latin America Asia","val":1394000000,"zh":"Eastern Europe Middle East Africa Latin America Asia"}],"total":11244000000}},"peers":["BDX","EW","CAH","BSX","SYK"]}}